    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《新竹米粉寮ê東德成米粉》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蔡秋芬</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhx-OTFRygzi90mRllmsvPZwemjEV7dryxBC_tkCi2uFPDmPVfhZziBbZhAHGyGQerkyRswn8olny5qLHmzzDJN8uFhdcH4sjNWn637JBvM67VzEkShkNNncCCcGE9L6zqKJa16pA_0t81CSagiwkUFmbbJPnh_RN0kg2CXa7V0Bvbv4_WiCwOv0Dj1vccH\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhx-OTFRygzi90mRllmsvPZwemjEV7dryxBC_tkCi2uFPDmPVfhZziBbZhAHGyGQerkyRswn8olny5qLHmzzDJN8uFhdcH4sjNWn637JBvM67VzEkShkNNncCCcGE9L6zqKJa16pA_0t81CSagiwkUFmbbJPnh_RN0kg2CXa7V0Bvbv4_WiCwOv0Dj1vccH=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj1iUsqaQ8tYlzi3jfHRGgiTxEWC5PdobpPT9MZ88VyR8ZbJfkbFnz1lr7cKf7Z2y0XZS7DfsASkdCR5yNqHoqBAHkgrvefW7Aq7PPM97SeLf9BJ6UzRxz0lkqptM1Zz8WoY-3zSqWORPY_Q4rZ5lvY63Lu3Xk_tfs3fQX8xJjvHqn90hJ6iNkokN91q8s1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj1iUsqaQ8tYlzi3jfHRGgiTxEWC5PdobpPT9MZ88VyR8ZbJfkbFnz1lr7cKf7Z2y0XZS7DfsASkdCR5yNqHoqBAHkgrvefW7Aq7PPM97SeLf9BJ6UzRxz0lkqptM1Zz8WoY-3zSqWORPY_Q4rZ5lvY63Lu3Xk_tfs3fQX8xJjvHqn90hJ6iNkokN91q8s1=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Uah！米粉炊好--ah！細膩，ài退後--ōo！」炊米粉ê lâng-sn̂g大門一下開，工廠內底即時白煙phōng-phōng-ing，大人囡仔ê心肝tsiâu tuè leh phi̍h-pho̍k-tshíng。9月份培育台語家庭計畫ê台語導覽，新竹市本土語推廣協會tshuā逐家來到南勢米粉寮內中唯一iáu願意hōo人參觀ê「東德成米粉工廠」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">傳承四代ê東德成，今仔日是第三代頭家親身出馬為阮紹介開破。頭家講，做炊粉無啥mih撇步hām獨家祕方，伊ê米粉kan-na在來米kah水niā-niā，米是彰化hia農會ê米，水是政府ê自來水kā hiânn--過，獨獨一項ài斟酌細膩--ê，是米粉kám炊有透、炊有熟，掠外就無別个mê角。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮事先去稽考ê時，是先熟sāi頭家娘，伊講起做炊粉ê往事，uì透早4點半開始e米，直直到beh倚10點出爐，長時間以來身體hām精神tsiâu是tsiânn大ê負擔，頭家koh bat因為siunn過忝頭，致使破病入院修養。後--來阮koh去過幾改，沓沓仔ē-tàng hām in ná朋友án-ne開講拍lā涼。阮問--in：「Lín規家伙仔lóng是新竹在地人，tio̍h--無？因為lín ê台語lóng是新竹腔！」In講：「Tio̍h--啊，阮lóng新竹在地--ê。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一點鐘ê行讀kan-na ē-tàng看著「uì攪粿tshè、kā硩hōo tsa̍t腹、到tàn入去tsinn出一條一條幼幼ê米粉、sak入去lâng-sn̂g炊」ê過程，就算án-ne，uân-á是一步一步tsiâu tio̍h人工，莫怪進前上kài tshia-iānn ê時、bat有百幾間ê南勢米粉寮，現此時已經賰無十間--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Tsit-má逐家lóng改用機器leh做--ah，我tsia是唯一傳統iáu用人工--ê，mā ē-tàng講是全台灣上細間--ê。我逐工ē-tàng做偌濟就偌濟，siunn濟我mā做bē去。」頭家喙ná替阮解sueh，手ná nuá粿tshè。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">等待ê làng縫，阮tshuā逐家行跤花到附近ê土地公廟歇涼，「十冬前，tsit箍圍仔ê厝，壁面頂lóng全全是leh畫米粉製作ê過程，逐家tsit-má看--著ê停車場tsit phiàn地，khah早就是leh曝米粉ê所在。」阮kí遠遠ê壁堵hām家己所徛ê位置，提進前ê相片hōo逐家來對照hiàng時hām tsit-tsūn。「是--ooh！Uah！阮lóng無注意--著！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">行踏過愈濟傳統市場kiau店家了後，阮愈來愈感覺著有ê mi̍h件，若是tsit-má無kā記錄--落-來，無的確真緊就ē消失kah無影無跡--ah。逐日現做、流汗流滴、純手工、百分之百純米ê tâm米粉，m̄知影十年後，lán iáu 有機會食--著？</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>米粉寮哀歌</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><div><b>五十年代水田規phiàn</b></div><div><b>日頭tshiō--來青ling-ling</b></div><div><b>客雅溪（Khiah-á-khue）坐清but-but甜</b></div><div><b>九降風吹天時地利</b></div><div><b>南勢在來米下港tia̍h</b></div><div><b>崙仔蓬萊米厝內用</b></div><div><b><br /></b></div><div><b>郭--家祖厝五合院</b></div><div><b>正身護龍上尾間</b></div><div><b>家家戶戶米粉廠</b></div><div><b>頭喙手工步步khînn</b></div><div><b>炊粉oh趁厚工費時</b></div><div><b>Iau bē死　脹bē肥</b></div><div><b><br /></b></div><div><b>中秋清明霜風gàn</b></div><div><b>米粉jió-toh第一等</b></div><div><b>透風ê時水粉日</b></div><div><b>炊粉thìng候風微微</b></div><div><b>百外間ê工廠ba̍t-ba̍t是</b></div><div><b>米粉寮米粉埔全台tshìng</b></div><div><b><br /></b></div><div><b>六十年代米價起</b></div><div><b>番麥粉lām-sám成事實</b></div><div><b>人工傷重機器進</b></div><div><b>公道三<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1</span>一通地值錢</b></div><div><b><br /></b></div><div><b>Hiàng時曝米粉ê美麗光景</b></div><div><b>現此時kan-na賰相片</b></div><div><b>南勢米粉寮ê繁盛tshia-iānn</b></div><div><b>永遠活踮序大in ê夢--裡</b></div></div><div><b><br /></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1 編註：新竹市一條路ê名。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=